# College Security Design

## Scenario
A college uses Salesforce to manage student records, faculty information, admissions, and administrative activities.

### Users
- Students
- Faculty Members
- Department Heads
- Administrative Staff
- Principal/Management

### Roles
- Principal
  - Department Head
    - Faculty
      - Students

### Profiles
#### Student Profile
- View own records
- Update limited personal information

#### Faculty Profile
- View student records
- Manage attendance and grades

#### Department Head Profile
- Access department-related records
- Review faculty activities

#### Administrator Profile
- Full access to the Salesforce organization

### Permission Sets
#### Attendance Management
- Manage attendance records

#### Reports Access
- Create and export reports

#### Admissions Access
- Manage admission-related records

